        {
            "name": "openclash",
            "owner": "vernesong",
            "repo": "openclash",
            "tag": null,
            "include": null,
            "id": "openclash",
            "info": [
                "<p>建议不用下载,使用命令线上安装!</p>",
                "<p>提示1: luci 管理,系统->软件包->更新列表,下载 luci-app-ttyd , 不用安装连接 ssh 工具 </p>",
                "<p>提示2: 刷新 luci 管理,服务-> Terminal 或 终端 登录 root 账号输入命令即可 </p>",
                "<h3>25.12 和 以上系统, ssh 命令行(一行一行复制):</h3>",
                "<p>apk update</p>",
                "<p>apk add curl ca-bundle</p>",
                "<p>curl -fsSL -o /tmp/install.sh https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vernesong/OpenClash@dev/install.sh && sh /tmp/install.sh</p>",
                "<h3> 24.10 和 以下系统, ssh 命令行(一行一行复制):</h3>",
                "<p>opkg update</p>",
                "<p>opkg install curl ca-bundle</p>",
                "<p>curl -fsSL -o /tmp/install.sh https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vernesong/OpenClash@dev/install.sh && sh /tmp/install.sh</p>"
            ]
        },
